{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/90763-some-questions","id":90763,"title":"Some questions.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-14T03:01:05-07:00","id":90763,"title":"Some questions.","content":"1. When a Werewolf or other Feras transform, what happened to their clothes after they revert back?<br /> <br /> 2. Can little kids become Kueijin?<br /> <br /> Also can little kids become Kindred?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1945-magicballz","name":"Magicballz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T03:15:12-07:00","id":90766,"title":"","content":"1. Unless the character in question has used a Rite to bind the clothes to him, they are ripped apart when the character changes forms.<br /> <br /> 2. In theory, kids can become Kuei-Jin, but I would say it happens very rarely. Kindred can be kids - there is even a Flaw called &quot;Child&quot; that covers it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1506-lubricus","name":"Lubricus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-16T19:23:50-07:00","id":92572,"title":"","content":"Are kid Kueijin and kindred usually weaker?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1945-magicballz","name":"Magicballz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-16T20:16:23-07:00","id":92599,"title":"","content":"Being a child is a listed flaw.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Child (3pt. Flaw)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">You were a small child (between five and 10 years</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">old) at the time of your Embrace, leaving your Physical</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Attributes underdeveloped and making it difficult to</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">interact with some aspects of mortal society. You may</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">not have more than two dots in Strength or Stamina</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">at character creation, except when raising Physical Attributes</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">with blood points, and the difficulties of all die</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">rolls when attempting to direct or lead mortal adults</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">are increased by two. Characters with this Flaw should</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">also take the Short Flaw.</span></span> </div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"<a href=http://imageshack.com/a/img703/6636/6kvo.png target=_blank>http://imageshack.com/a/img703/6636/6kvo.png</a>\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"<a href=http://imageshack.com/a/img692/7017/hh2support.png target=_blank>http://imageshack.com/a/img692/7017/hh2support.png</a>\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2323-killersquirrel59","name":"killersquirrel59","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"558"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}